# Runtime state written by the engine itself (not source).
# `session_notes.json` is the epoch dehydration briefing: main.rs writes it at
# the default path whenever no explicit path is configured, so a tracked copy
# goes dirty on every run and reads as a "file a human is editing" when it is
# nothing of the kind.
session_notes.json
